# A didChange no longer runs a synchronous full re-analysis
# (issues/fixed/lsp-per-keystroke-full-reanalysis-limits-responsiveness.md):
# the text is retained at once and the analysis is debounced to the idle
# window, so the hover written straight after the didChange is answered from
# the last parsed outcome BEFORE any publishDiagnostics for the change, and
# the conversation's end (EOF/exit) still delivers the final diagnostics.
# Before the fix the stream showed the change's publishDiagnostics between
# the didChange and the hover reply (the hover queued behind a ~3 s full
# evaluation on compiler-sized files) and nothing after the shutdown reply.
timeout=240
framing=strict
